PROJECT: TRANSITION STRATEGIZER

Core Idea:
A large-scale societal transition away from:
- currency dependence
- hierarchical control systems

Toward:
- needs-based provisioning
- decentralized coordination
- non-coercive systems

Key Concepts:
- Money as control mechanism rather than necessity
- Reinforced behaviors dominate societies
- Power suppresses empathy (neuro/psych basis)

Major Components:
- Transition starter kit
- Mutual aid playbooks
- Distributed energy systems
- Truth literacy training
- Advertising immunity training

Approach:
- Dual-track:
  • Build new system
  • Survive within current system

Status:
- Deep conceptual development
- Stress testing underway
- Simulation integration planned
